A `prefix.changed` naming `unattributed` while carrying a diff that names the
line that changed. The residual is the class for bytes that moved with no part
of the head naming what moved; a residual carrying evidence has thrown away
what it was holding.

The other direction is refused by `prefix-reason-disagrees-with-its-diff`: the
pair is the rule in both directions, and `unattributed` is the one class whose
diff is empty.
